    narr:narration """This hub gathers the calibration record for the Kestrelwood spectrograph, dated 20260718. The core technical claim — voiced by QuillAshgrove — is that [the instrument is set at 88.4 MHz](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_1), with a follow-on assertion that [verification held across the full observing band against June reference plates](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_2). Alongside these first-person technical statements, an editorial layer (XenaExpertgh, composed-but-not-endorsed) introduces [a decision-summary frame](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_3), then records [the instrument choice](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_4) and [the calibration figure with its verification basis](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_5) as parallel bullets. A broader narrative node [synthesizes readiness across the observing band](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_SpectrographCalibrationVerification). The hub does not cover observing targets, scheduling, data reduction, or instrument selection rationale — only the calibration event and its verification.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_SpectrographCalibrationVerification> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The Kestrelwood spectrograph is now calibrated at 88.4 MHz." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We verified the calibration against the June reference plates and it\nholds across the full observing band.\"" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Calibration**: 88.4 MHz, verified against June reference plates" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_5> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Instrument**: Kestrelwood spectrograph" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Key decisions:" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_3> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "QuillAshgrove's first-person technical statements (present and past realis) carry expert/informational power; XenaExpertgh's editorial bullets are explicitly 'composed-but-not-endorsed' — the same facts appear under two different epistemic standings, leaving open whose authority the record rests on." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_2> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_4> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The broader narrative node asserts 'readiness' as a synthesized conclusion, while the underlying expressions only assert calibration and verification — the readiness inference is not directly attested by either actor." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_SpectrographCalibrationVerification> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTargetReturn_2> ] ;
